{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達公司於今日宣佈，其董事會已正式成立國家安全與出口管制監督委員會。這是一個全新的常設委員會，主要負責對公司的國家安全政策、出口管制合規性以及全球貿易風險管理進行董事會級別的監督。英偉達現有的國家安全團隊和全球貿易合規團隊將在日常運營中直接向該委員會以及臨時行政總裁科萊特克雷斯匯報。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586792.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T12:33:58.280059+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:11:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T12:27:13.176094+00:00","content_hash":"f07d6d12fa495033fcfc5ad87fe4bd1cbf5235d696c4a422edaa740cf57a99d9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}